Z||000004||87GT||06-27-99||10:31 PM||||Yellowformula, I know what you mean about being young.  I am only 20 and when I read some of the ways to fix problems on these cars, I pray to god that nothing complicated happens with my car.  My cousins best friend is the man I bought the car from.  My cousin is a mechanic and knows my Fiero back and forth so hopefully, if something drastic happens, I can take it to him and have it done without paying out the yazoo.  When it comes to fiero styles, I will always love the GT fastback look.  I really never cared for the notchback version, BUT I am starting to like it more and more.  I've seen some really nice notchbacks around here.  Welp, see ya!
